# Cursor Rules — examresource Frontend

## ⚠️ MANDATORY: Read Before ANY Frontend Task
Before performing any frontend work, you MUST read these files:
1. `design.md` — Design system tokens, color palette, typography, component specs
2. `public/blog_formatting_seo_guidelines.md` — Blog formatting and SEO standards

## Tech Stack
- Astro v7 (SSG/SSR)
- Tailwind CSS v4 (using @theme directive in src/styles/global.css)
- DM Sans (primary font), Geist (display/labels), ui-monospace (code)
- Bun as package manager and runtime

## Design System Summary
- Dark canvas: #131316 | Primary: #292418 | CTA Accent: #327CF6
- Surface: #1C1B1F | Border: #2A2925 | Text: #FFFFFF | Muted: #A0A0A3
- Pill buttons (rounded-full), rounded cards (20px), micro-shadow elevation
- Mobile-first responsive, generous whitespace, high contrast

## Blog Content Rules
- Structured Markdown/MDX → semantic HTML at build time
- One H1, logical H2/H3 hierarchy
- Article/BlogPosting structured data
- Verify facts against official sources
- Full guidelines in public/blog_formatting_seo_guidelines.md
